OL,3,GNEWSAShoebox appeals fear people to
OL,4,Amiss out over costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of Christmas shoebox appeals
OL,7,Fare fearing people could be left out
OL,8,Fthis year as donations drop due to
OL,9,Fpeople facing cost of living struggles.
OL,11,FAge Concern Tyneside South, which gives
OL,12,Fshoeboxes filled with Christmas
OL,13,Fpresents to local lonely and vulnerable
OL,14,Fpeople aged over 50, feared they could
OL,15,Fbe left with 200 to 300 shoeboxes -
OL,16,Fdown from about the usual figure of
OL,17,F700.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,392,390,260,160,0,100
