OL,3,GNEWSAShoebox appeals fear people to
OL,4,Amiss out over costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Link to Hope North East -
OL,7,Fwhich sends them to Eastern European
OL,8,Fchildren - said it had to be "careful"
OL,9,Fas it collected shoeboxes across the
OL,10,Fregion due to fuel prices.
OL,12,FIn Ulverston, St Bethany's Church has
OL,13,Fknitted its own gifts to help fill
OL,14,Fshoeboxes being sent to children
OL,15,Foverseas by charity Samaritan's Purse.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
